  "body": "https://spec.matrix.org/latest/rooms/v10/ is a thing. I think the changes are:\r\n * [ ] support the `knock_restricted` join rule. We already have this in the MSC3787 room version type, so this should be trivial\r\n * [ ] forbid strings in PL events, per https://spec.matrix.org/latest/rooms/v10/#values-in-mroompower_levels-events-must-be-integers",
